{"unit_id":"ringoage__dsh-subagent-model-picker#card-zh","repo":"ringoage/dsh-subagent-model-picker","commit":"771082e64f3a1a8a1ab8b2f4e44d073b3d27ea2b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-model-picker 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的子代理模型选择插件。在会话输入栏的主模型选择器旁加入子代理模型菜单，用户可以按会话指定 provider、model 和可选的 reasoning effort；选择保存在主机设置中，并由 agent/request 监听器应用于进程内子代理。菜单可恢复继承主模型，也能按模型支持情况选择思考程度。适合希望明确控制子代理模型、同时保留主代理模型设置的 DSH 用户。通过 DSH Remote 服务在客户端和主机间读写选择状态；无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:537-546","lib/index.js:40-60","lib/index.js:82-112"]}
{"unit_id":"ringoage__dsh-subagent-model-picker#card-en","repo":"ringoage/dsh-subagent-model-picker","commit":"771082e64f3a1a8a1ab8b2f4e44d073b3d27ea2b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subagent-model-picker adds a model menu beside DSH web's main selector. Choose a provider, model and optional reasoning effort per session. The host saves this choice and applies it to in-process subagents; users can restore the main model. No extra API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:537-546","lib/index.js:40-60","lib/index.js:82-112"]}
