{"unit_id":"ringoage__dsh-subagent-model-picker#feature-1","repo":"ringoage/dsh-subagent-model-picker","commit":"771082e64f3a1a8a1ab8b2f4e4d073b3d27ea2b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-model-picker 的功能「按会话选模型」：在会话菜单选择 provider 和 model，保存后用于该会话的进程内子代理请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:537-546","lib/index.js:92-109","lib/index.js:198-221"]}
