{"unit_id":"ringoage__dsh-subagent-model-picker#feature-4","repo":"ringoage/dsh-subagent-model-picker","commit":"771082e64f3a1a8a1ab8b2f4e44d073b3d27ea2b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-model-picker 的功能「覆盖进程内子代理路由」：主机监听 agent/request，识别 subagentDepth 大于零的代理，并沿父会话关系找到根会话的选择；主代理请求保持原模型配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:82-112","lib/index.js:141-173"]}
